摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Skin marketplace for DeepSeek Harness — search and install community skins from dsh.a2hmarket.ai right in the settings page","id":"gh:1338404631","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-skin-market","slug":"keman-ai/dsh-skin-market","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","marketplace","plugin","skin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Skin marketplace for DeepSeek Harness — search and install community skins from dsh.a2hmarket.ai rig"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ht in the settings page"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH Skin Market"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Search for skins inside DeepSeek Harness and install them with one click."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Install it once, and changing skins never sends you back to the terminal."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"dsh.a2hmarket.ai\n— where the skin catalog comes from, no login required"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"If this is useful to you, a Star goes a long way"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Three tabs"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Discover\nSearch, sort, install in one click. Each card states whether the skin is a prebuilt package"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" or built from source — so you know whether the click costs seconds or minutes before you make it."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Installed\nVersion, theme id, enable / disable, uninstall. It reads the local profile, so it works of"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"fline — even the previews are served locally, with no extra network use."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Diagnostics　·　pnpm, the profile path, registry connectivity and the full output of the last install "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"— the first screen to check when something will not install, and far more useful than a screenshot"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> **The source of every official skin on the site lives in dsh-skin-pack.**"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Restart dsh once, then open **Settings → Skin Market**."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**From then on, installing a skin only takes a page refresh — no restart, no commands.**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> **`-w` is not optional.** The profile directory ships a `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, so pnpm reads it as"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" a workspace root and refuses to install (`ERR_PNPM_ADDING_TO_ROOT`). `-w` is the \"yes, install into"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" the root\" declaration, and `dsh plugin` forwards it to pnpm verbatim. Both pnpm 8 and 10 need it."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The repository ships its build output (`lib/`) and has no `prepare` script, so pnpm runs no build sc"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ript when installing from a git source and you never have to grant `allowBuilds`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"If you run harness from source, replace both `dsh` commands above with `pnpm dsh` inside the harness"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"harness from source, replace both `dsh` commands above with `pnpm dsh` inside the harness directory."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Uninstall"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Skins installed through the market do not disappear with it — they are independent dependencies in t"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"he profile, uninstalled individually from the market's Installed tab."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**Browsing** needs only dsh and a network. **Installing** is what needs the command-line tools, beca"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"use installing is fundamentally running `pnpm` on your behalf."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Dependency | Requirement | What happens without it |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| **DeepSeek Harness** | `0.1.0-rc.6+` (tested on rc.7) | Earlier versions lack `settings.section` a"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"nd the browser module table, so the plugin cannot mount |\n| **profile** | Must be the **web** profil"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"e | headless / tui bundles have no `webServer`, so the plugin never activates |\n| **Node.js** | `>= "},{"id":"p27s4","text":"20` (tested on 24) | dsh's own requirement; the plugin does not raise it |\n| **pnpm** | On `PATH` (t"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"ested on 8.15 and 10) | Affects installing only. Diagnostics flags it red and the install button rep"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"orts a clear error, while browsing and search continue |\n| **git** | Only for GitHub-source skins | "},{"id":"p27s7","text":"Most catalog skins now use Release tarballs (no git needed); only a few remain `github:owner/repo` s"},{"id":"p27s8","text":"ources |\n| **Network** | `dsh.a2hmarket.ai`; also `github.com` for GitHub-source skins | An unreacha"},{"id":"p27s9","text":"ble registry falls back to the cache or bundled snapshot, and the page says so |\n| **Browser** | Ins"},{"id":"p27s10","text":"talling requires a **direct local connection** (loopback) | Remote access can browse and search; ins"},{"id":"p27s11","text":"talling is refused |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The plugin itself has a single runtime dependency: `yaml`, used to read and write the profile's patc"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"gin itself has a single runtime dependency: `yaml`, used to read and write the profile's patch file."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"No configuration is needed by default. To change something, append a section to the profile's `cordi"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"s.patch.yml` (`$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`) overriding this plugin's row by id:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"After changing code, run `pnpm build` again and restart dsh. When the plugin is installed into a pro"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"file with `link:`, there is no need to `add` it again."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"**`lib/` is committed on purpose**: pnpm does not run build scripts for git sources by default, so a"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" package without build output is missing its entry file and stops dsh from starting. Commit the `pnp"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"m build` output along with your code changes."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### The two halves"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| | File | Responsibility |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"| host | `src/index.ts` | Mounts `/skin-market/api/*` on `ctx.webServer`: catalog proxy and cache, i"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"nstalled list, install/uninstall (streaming pnpm output over SSE), diagnostics |\n| client | `src/cli"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ent/index.ts` | Registers `settings.section`, renders the list, search and install interactions |"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The two halves talk over **same-origin HTTP** rather than `ctx.remote` — the remote capability set i"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"s fixed at `api-remotes` build time and third-party plugins cannot add to it."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"`lib/client.js` is CJS in closure-factory form (`window.__ModuleLoader__.load({ id, factory })`); ex"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"ternal dependencies such as React come from the host-injected `require` via the module table and are"},{"id":"p40s3","text":" not bundled. That shape is dictated by dsh's module table, and `tsdown.config.ts` reproduces it."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### Harness types"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"`types/dsh.d.ts` vendors the parts of the harness API we use, transcribed from the 0.1.0-rc.7 source"},{"id":"p42s2","text":" with the origin noted at each site — these modules are all external at runtime, and the `@deepseek-"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"ai/dsh-client-*` dependency chain on npm is currently incomplete and cannot be installed. When host "},{"id":"p42s4","text":"behaviour disagrees with the declarations, check that file first."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Related"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| dsh.a2hmarket.ai | The skin catalog site where authors publish. This plugin's catalog is fetched f"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"rom it |\n| dsh-skin-pack | The source of the official skins, all in one repository |"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"MIT © 2026 Science Roam Limited"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"If this is useful to you, a Star goes a long way"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
